flowchart LR
    Patient[Patient]
    Doctor[Doctor]
    Receptionist[Receptionist]
    Admin[Administrator]

    P1((1.0 Authenticate and Authorize))
    P2((2.0 Manage Users and Profiles))
    P3((3.0 Manage Doctors and Availability))
    P4((4.0 Manage Appointments))
    P5((5.0 Manage Medical Records))
    P6((6.0 Manage Billing))
    P7((7.0 Audit and Reporting))

    D1[(D1 Users and Profiles)]
    D2[(D2 Doctor Availability)]
    D3[(D3 Appointments)]
    D4[(D4 Medical Records and Prescriptions)]
    D5[(D5 Invoices)]
    D6[(D6 Audit Logs)]

    Patient -->|Credentials| P1
    Doctor -->|Credentials| P1
    Receptionist -->|Credentials| P1
    Admin -->|Credentials| P1
    P1 -->|Session/token and access result| Patient
    P1 -->|Session/token and access result| Doctor
    P1 -->|Session/token and access result| Receptionist
    P1 -->|Session/token and access result| Admin
    P1 <--> D1

    Patient -->|Registration and profile data| P2
    Receptionist -->|Patient registration and profile updates| P2
    Admin -->|Staff account and role changes| P2
    P2 <--> D1
    P2 -->|Patient or staff profile result| Patient
    P2 -->|Profile information| Receptionist
    P2 -->|Account status and user information| Admin

    Doctor -->|Availability periods and profile changes| P3
    Admin -->|Doctor profile and configuration changes| P3
    Patient -->|Doctor and slot search| P3
    Receptionist -->|Doctor and slot search| P3
    P3 <--> D1
    P3 <--> D2
    P3 -->|Available doctors and time slots| Patient
    P3 -->|Available doctors and time slots| Receptionist

    Patient -->|Booking or cancellation request| P4
    Receptionist -->|Booking, rescheduling or cancellation request| P4
    Doctor -->|Appointment status update| P4
    P4 <--> D2
    P4 <--> D3
    P4 -->|Appointment confirmation and status| Patient
    P4 -->|Assigned appointment list| Doctor
    P4 -->|Schedule and appointment status| Receptionist

    Doctor -->|Diagnosis, notes and prescription| P5
    Patient -->|Medical history request| P5
    P5 <--> D3
    P5 <--> D4
    P5 -->|Authorized medical history and prescriptions| Patient
    P5 -->|Assigned patient history| Doctor

    Receptionist -->|Invoice details and payment status| P6
    Admin -->|Billing oversight| P6
    Patient -->|Invoice request| P6
    P6 <--> D3
    P6 <--> D5
    P6 -->|Invoice and billing status| Patient
    P6 -->|Invoice result| Receptionist
    P6 -->|Billing summary| Admin

    Admin -->|Report and audit request| P7
    P7 <--> D1
    P7 <--> D3
    P7 <--> D5
    P7 <--> D6
    P1 -->|Security event| D6
    P2 -->|Account event| D6
    P4 -->|Appointment event| D6
    P5 -->|Clinical record event| D6
    P6 -->|Billing event| D6
    P7 -->|Operational reports and audit information| Admin

    classDef external fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#1F4E79,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#102A43;
    classDef process fill:#FFF2CC,stroke:#BF9000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3B00;
    classDef store fill:#F4CCCC,stroke:#990000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A0000;
    class Patient,Doctor,Receptionist,Admin external;
    class P1,P2,P3,P4,P5,P6,P7 process;
    class D1,D2,D3,D4,D5,D6 store;
